/*
 * School: Diablo Valley College
 * Term: 2017 Fall
 * Course: ComSc-110-3120,
 *         Introduction to Programming with C++
 *
 * Chapter: 06
 * Program: Pr06a-Tax-Agopian-Armand.cpp
